**Example Patent Claim**

1. An electronic device comprising:  
   a housing;  
   a display supported by the housing, the display comprising a substantially planar display portion and a curved display portion;  
   a first processor;  
   a second processor operatively coupled to the first processor; and  
   memory storing instructions that, when executed by at least one of the first processor or the second processor, cause rendering operations for the display to be allocated between the first processor and the second processor.
